====Write a program to check whether a number is positive, negative, or zero====

num=int(input("Enter The Number:"))
if num>0:
    print("Positive:")
elif num<0:
    print("Negative:")
else:
    print("Zero:")



=====Build a simple grading system: take marks as input and print the grade (A/B/C/D/F) using if-elif-else=====

marks=int(input("Enter Student Marks:"))
if marks>=90:
    print("Grade:A")
elif marks>=80:
    print("Grade:B")
elif marks>=60:
    print("Grade:C")
else:
    print("Grade:D")